WEBVTT

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.710
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:27.330
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:57.240
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:58.970
♪As such♪

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.850
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.010
♪As such♪

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.410
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:12.850
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.770
♪Everywhere♪

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:21.850
♪I regret not the time
we spent together♪

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:27.850
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:33.530
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:40.450
♪A cherished love♪

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:46.090
♪Can never be parted♪

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:52.490
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:01:52.850 --> 00:02:01.635
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:02:01.662 --> 00:02:07.820
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:11.950
=Episode 5=
(An Old Acquaintance)

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.410
It's still warm.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.270
That person sure is careful.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.330
There isn't anyone here.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.230
Hanguang-jun,

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.920
you don't often read those novels.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.280
You can't catch
these sorts of characters

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.590
that easily.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.480
Oh, your headband is askew.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:07.680
Oh, look at you fumbling.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:08.770
Why don't you just take it off?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.820
You... You actually took it off.

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:16.740
Lan... Lan Zhan,

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.890
what are you trying to do?

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.420
(Liquor)

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.490
This is more like it.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:27.670
All of us just made it out from Yi City.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.100
We've shared
a life and death experience.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.770
We shouldn't be arguing.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:34.550
Drink up!

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.950
Your alcohol tolerance is terrible.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.330
Zizhen,

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.020
let's keep drinking!

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.730
Zizhen has returned to Baling.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:45.820
I'm Lan Sizhui.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:47.550
Hm?

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:50.590
Oh, Lan Sizhui.

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:52.190
The annoying guy

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.590
who is a stickler for the rules.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:54.660
Rules? What rules?

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.660
Even if Hanguang-jun was here today,

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.460
I would still drink
to my heart's content!

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.460
Drink up!

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.580
Han... Hanguang-jun!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.020
Hanguang-jun.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.790
Weren't you resting on the second floor?

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:07.710
Why are you...

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.060
It was stuffy inside.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.140
So Hanguang-jun went out for a walk.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.140
And we thought
we would check up on you guys.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:16.970
And look.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:19.490
We caught three of you here
sneakily drinking alcohol.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.610
Hanguang-jun, your headband.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.320
What... What is he doing?

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:29.160
He is demonstrating a special use
of the Lan Clan's headband.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.560
What? "Special use"?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.690
For instance,
when you run into a strange corpse

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:37.460
and need to capture it and bring it back
with you for further investigation.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.160
You can use the headband

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:41.210
and tie them up like this.

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:45.230
You can't do that! Our headband is...

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:46.930
I see.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.220
I didn't know
that it could be used this way.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:49.560
Huh?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:52.870
Lan Zhan,

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:54.910
you won't be able to face them

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.660
when you wake up and sober up tomorrow.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.310
Do you still want your headband back?

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:04.550
Yes.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.340
Then, hurry up and untie me.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.230
No.

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.920
Oh, you're still sober enough
to answer me.

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.110
All right. Let me ask you something.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:13.210
Have you

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.130
ever stolen a sip of the Emperor's Smile
you hid in your room?

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:17.490
No.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.130
Do you like rabbits?

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.390
Yes.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.340
Have you ever broken the rules before?

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:23.850
Yes.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.870
How did you recognize me?

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.160
Why are you helping me?

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:30.790
Oh, I see.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.790
You pretend not to understand me
at moments like these, huh?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.660
Come on. Just tell me, Lan Zhan.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.140
Oh, no.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.240
It's "Good Brother".

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.210
We only missed
a night of playing "Rest" for him,

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:53.670
and he has already
pieced himself back together.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:55.830
Don't move!

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.620
Senior Mo, you're so loud.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:58.880
Aren't you afraid that he'll notice you?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.660
Don't worry. He is headless.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:02.820
He can't hear or see.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:04.450
It doesn't matter how loud you are.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:07.100
Really? Let me try.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:08.710
Hey!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.270
Didn't you say it would be all right?

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:14.340
Huh?

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:19.160
He is only going after Jin Ling?

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.420
So that's how it is.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.030
- Zewu-jun!
- Zewu-jun!

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:54.610
From the looks of it,

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.650
even as powerful
as Dustless and New Moon are,

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.240
they won't be able to subdue him.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.260
Who on earth is this fierce corpse?

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:08.880
Such power and strength.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.290
Could it be that he really is...

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:15.990
Lan Zhan!

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:17.120
Catch it!

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:29.320
This posture.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.010
"Good Brother" used

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.340
to practice sabers.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:22.930
Lan Zhan,

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.930
did you figure out

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.280
who he is,
just like your elder brother did?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:28.710
Huh?

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.620
He actually fell asleep standing up.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.970
Seven feet tall.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.330
A muscular build.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:47.830
He wielded a sword,

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.840
but his techniques revealed
the ways of a saber.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:51.640
Many cultivators wield swords.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:52.890
Only a few wield sabers,

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.300
and even fewer
manage to achieve such skill.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:55.630
Clan Leader Lan,

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.790
is this the late Clan Leader
of the Nie Clan of Qinghe,

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.050
Chifeng-zun?

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:03.150
Based on your expression,

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.290
it seems you have an idea of the person

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.480
who tore his soul into pieces
is as well.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.040
No.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.960
The Tomb of Blades
of Nie Clan in Qinghe.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.520
The men in black were familiar
with the Lan Clan's sword techniques.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.520
The mastermind behind all of those men

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.370
must have close ties to the Lan Clan.

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:22.320
He knows the secret
of the Tomb of Blades of the Nie Clan,

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.580
and has a connection to Chifeng-zun.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:27.680
Among everyone in the hall earlier,

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.120
Chifeng-zun
only attacked Jin Ling and me.

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:32.120
Both of us only have one thing
in common.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.120
The blood of Jin

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.510
runs in both of our veins.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:38.710
It can't be him.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:39.950
Clan Leader Lan,

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:42.720
the annual Discussion Conference
will be held at Jinlintai soon.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.010
If everything goes as expected,

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:45.880
the truth

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.080
will soon be revealed.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:51.380
(Jinlintai)

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:55.400
(I understand)

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.400
(that due to various reasons,)

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.300
(many people
have misconceptions of Yao.)

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:00.770
(But)

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.870
(I only believe in what I have seen)

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:04.390
(in all these years
I have spent with him.)

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.630
(I have faith in him.)

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.080
Lan Zhan.

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:30.770
What significance does the headband

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.080
actually hold for the Lan Clan?

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.900
How many times were you told
to copy the "Rules and Etiquette"

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.330
when you were studying in Gusu?

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.310
Five? Six?

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.600
I can't remember.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.750
Why do you ask?

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.190
You've copied them for nothing.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.400
Pretending to be mysterious.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:57.920
Speaking of which,

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:01.000
you said a lot when you were drunk
last night, Lan Zhan.

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.350
What did I say?

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:05.310
Nothing much.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:08.190
Things like... Hm...

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:10.590
You said

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:12.530
you really like

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.320
rabbits!

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.800
It's not a big deal, Hanguang-jun.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:19.800
Rabbits are adorable.
Who wouldn't like them?

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:20.840
I like them too.

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:22.540
I like to eat them!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:26.270
Hey! Wait for me, Lan Zhan!

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:32.140
Clan Leader Lan.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:33.580
Hanguang-jun.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:34.860
Clan Leader Jiang.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:39.530
You have never brought
an outsider with you here.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:41.200
What a surprise.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.200
I wonder who this special
and talented guest of yours is.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.710
Won't you introduce me to him?

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:47.330
Well...

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:48.260
Xichen.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.260
Yao.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.550
Why didn't you tell me
Wangji was coming too?

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:58.970
- Lianfang-zun.
- Lianfang-zun.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.360
I've troubled you a lot to help
with the preparations, Xichen.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.840
It is nothing.
You're too courteous, Yao.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:06.660
Uncle.

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.880
So you still know that I'm your uncle.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:12.480
Clan Leader Jiang,

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.480
Ling knew his mistakes.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.200
He was so worried
about how you would punish him

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.480
that he could hardly eat.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.970
You spoil him the most.

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:20.290
Don't be too harsh on him.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:20.960
That's right.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.200
Uncle Guangyao can attest to that.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.780
I haven't had much
of an appetite for the past few days.

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:25.520
You look healthy to me.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.520
You must have been eating well.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:31.580
Why are you here?

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.580
For a free meal.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.490
How dare you still show up here!

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:36.600
Didn't I tell you...

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.020
All visitors are our guests.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.020
Jinlintai may not have much,

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.610
but we certainly
have enough to feed all of you.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:45.290
Lan Clan of Gusu. Jiang Clan of Yunmeng.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:46.790
Please enter the hall from here.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:49.540
Let's leave the talk for later then.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.160
Please head inside
and take your seats first, everyone.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:52.680
I'll be there shortly.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.290
Ling, you head inside too.

00:13:56.990 --> 00:13:58.290
All right, Uncle Guangyao.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.630
Su Clan of Moling.
Please enter the hall from here.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.420
(The Su Clan of Moling?)

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:11.710
(I've never heard of it.)

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:13.220
(A new clan?)

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.340
(I think I've seen)

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.890
(Clan Leader Su somewhere before.)

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:31.750
Who is that man?

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.060
Why is he sitting next to Hanguang-jun?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.320
(Jin Chan)
Mo Xuanyu.

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:38.680
How dare that shameless brat returned.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:39.780
Hanguang-jun.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:40.910
Hanguang-jun.

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:42.420
What is it?

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.520
You must not leave my side today.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:47.100
If anyone were to come up to me
and tried to start a conversation,

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:48.870
I might speak nonsense
and be taken for a mad fool,

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.650
that would reflect badly on you.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.520
All you have to do
is not provoke others.

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:56.520
That's easy enough.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:01.260
Clan Leader Jin and his wife,
Madam Jin, have arrived.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.260
(Qin Su)

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:16.240
(Qin Su?)

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:20.020
(The daughter of Qin Cangye,
Jin Guangshan's subordinate?)

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:24.440
(Didn't Qin Cangye strongly oppose
their marriage back then)

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.050
(because of Jin Guangyao's heritage?)

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:30.630
Today, I have invited all of you here
for the annual Discussion Conference.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.120
We are honored to have the prestigious members
and clans of the cultivation world here.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.160
We hold this banquet
to welcome all of you.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.920
I hereby toast

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.230
to a successful discussion conference

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.790
for the next seven days.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:42.860
A toast to everyone.

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:44.590
A toast to a successful conference.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.650
The cultivation world is in a state
of peace and harmony right now.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:55.260
It is a blessing for us

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:58.380
to have Lianfang-zun
as our Chief Cultivator.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:02.760
However,

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.800
there have been
some concerning rumors lately.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:06.560
That person

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.860
seems to have returned.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:08.800
Who?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.760
The Yiling Patriarch.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.870
Wei Wuxian.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.580
I heard rumors of that too.

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:19.260
The Ghost General was summoned
by the Yiling Patriarch,

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.650
and appeared on Dafan Mountain.

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.060
The person
who summoned the Ghost General

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:25.960
was not the Yiling Patriarch.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.520
Who else could it be then?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.510
Could the Ghost General even
be controlled by another person?

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.680
That's right.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.590
Mo Xuanyu

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:37.780
is skilled in demonic cultivation.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:41.350
He single-handedly destroyed
the corpse-trapping array at Huaicang Mountain.

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:43.510
Who else but the Yiling Patriarch

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:46.260
could have the skills
and ability to do such a thing?

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:50.240
But Clan Leader Jiang's Purple Lightning
had no effect on him!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.110
The Purple Lightning makes no mistakes.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.290
My brother's innocence has been proven.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.550
As for the rumors
of him practicing demonic cultivation,

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.310
you may share your opinions

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:05.480
during the discussion conference tomorrow.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:07.480
Please.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.430
Thank you
for your guidance, Hanguang-jun.

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:31.450
I shall take my leave now.

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.980
(I'll head outside first.)

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.260
I failed to track the direction
using the Demonic Left Arm again.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.260
It sure is hard

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.620
to find a head in this huge place.

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:05.680
Oh, you managed to dodge.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:06.960
You've improved.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.720
What's the matter, Mo Xuanyu?

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.120
Did your memory fail you?

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.710
How dare you still show your face here.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:13.870
Get him.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.840
What are you afraid of?

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:19.330
He was chased out of here
only a few months ago.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.530
He is no someone.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.300
Get him!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.200
What's going on?

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:25.760
Jin Ling?

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:26.880
Hey, Jin Chan,

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.330
you'll have to
through Hanguang-jun first

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.330
if you want to lay a hand on him.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.690
Here I thought it was someone important.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:33.710
Jin Ling,

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.640
didn't you used to hate him too?

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.450
That lunatic harassed Lianfang-zun!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.710
And you're still standing up for him?

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:40.490
Who?

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.700
Lianfang-zun?

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:42.930
Jin Guangyao?

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:45.030
(Oh, Mo Xuanyu.)

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:47.830
(It's one thing for you
to stare and bother someone else,)

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:48.960
(but why did you have to...)

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.460
I can't lay a hand on him.

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:52.070
But I sure can deal with you.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.090
Don't call your dog here if you dare!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:54.280
Dog?

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.370
I can take you guys down

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:57.830
even without Fairy!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.040
Hit him!

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:05.880
Left!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.810
Why are you still standing there?

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.160
What? Hey!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:18.900
Have you learned it?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.380
Do you want to die?

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:21.810
Pretentious tricks.

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:22.550
Get him!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:27.030
Watch carefully now.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.060
Did you not see it?

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.550
Let's do it again then.

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:44.240
Have you learned it, Jin Ling?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:47.940
Yes.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.490
You... You'll pay for this!

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:07.980
Let's go!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.760
I'm not afraid of you!

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:13.610
A bunch of silly geese.

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:15.370
You look happy.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.590
Is this your first time
winning against them?

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.520
I always win one-on-one.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.220
But they always come in groups.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.140
They're shameless.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.000
Want to learn a few more tricks from me?

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.390
I guarantee you'll win in fights.

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:27.190
How about it?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:29.590
Why are you like this?

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.860
Uncle Guangyao always
tells me not to fight.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.630
But you're encouraging me to fight.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.440
Are you Wei Ying?

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.090
What do you think?

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.140
Never mind.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.600
I doubt you have the guts to lie to me.

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:49.000
And

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.450
stop bothering Uncle Guangyao.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:52.450
Don't worry.

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:54.110
I've long moved on from him.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.210
Who? What?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.210
Bai from the stables?

00:20:58.210 --> 00:20:59.030
Jin from the fish pond?

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:00.270
Or is it

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.610
my Fairy?

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.170
What the heck are you talking about?

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.290
I told you before
on Dafan Mountain, didn't I?

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:08.790
You... What did you say back then?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:12.050
My type

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.330
is someone like Hanguang-jun.

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:16.180
You...

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:18.620
Hanguang-jun!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.370
I... I'll take my leave now.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.540
Running off just like that?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.780
"Hanguang-jun"?

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.170
Who do you think you're fooling?

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:31.570
"Don't worry."

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.340
"I've long moved on."

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:39.750
Lan Zhan,

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.390
how long have you been here?

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:43.520
Well, Jin Ling

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.010
is always alone.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.630
He doesn't even have someone
to fight with him by his side.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:49.020
Doesn't Jin Guangyao
have a son or a daughter

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:51.020
around his age that's close to him?

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:53.570
Jin Guangyao had a son.

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:55.250
But the child was murdered

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:56.610
and passed away at a young age.

00:21:58.890 --> 00:22:00.910
That is the young master of Jin Clan!

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:02.650
How could he have been murdered?

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:04.130
The observation towers.

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:08.330
He was killed by one of the clans
who opposed the plan?

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:09.710
What happened to them after that?

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.710
The entire clan was wiped out.

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:21.140
(Fangfei Palace)

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:41.980
(Your son's death was not...)

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.010
♪The swallows♪

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:57.130
♪Fly away♪

00:22:57.450 --> 00:22:59.250
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:00.890
♪I strum the strings♪

00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:02.090
♪And play the song♪

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:03.890
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:05.730
♪Who is sighing♪

00:23:05.770 --> 00:23:06.770
♪In sorrow?♪

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.090
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:10.530
♪When all is said and done♪

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:13.170
♪I cherish every moment we are together♪

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:15.330
♪A toast♪

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.610
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:23:16.730 --> 00:23:18.370
♪We sit in a boat,
gazing up to the moon♪

00:23:18.970 --> 00:23:20.130
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:21.250
♪On the shore♪

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.330
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:24.810
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:26.130
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:27.970
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:29.730
♪No amount of gold♪

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:33.210
♪Would bring me to give up
these precious memories♪

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.850
♪I wish never to forget those years♪

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.570
♪I spent searching for you♪

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:41.090
♪Through the mountains and rivers♪

00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:44.290
♪I've searched for you♪

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:46.410
♪There you were♪

00:23:47.130 --> 00:23:48.850
♪By the dim light♪

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:52.850
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:56.170
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:58.610
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.930
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:03.610
♪Playing a song together♪

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:05.810
♪As we watch the sunset♪

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:08.010
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:11.370
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
